  "reroute_reason": {
   "kind": "rtl_change",
   "reason": "KV-GRP2 structural redesign (owner: one failed route = redesign): sq1 clock FAIL 114/124 ps and the sq2/sq3 gates retired on source prerequisites (y__tep alias hold -74.9 ps, unregistered i_ctl cones, 9.98 contacts/um SRAM faces, 8-deep LD shift chain).  New RTL qkd_kvs_grp_s2 (registered faces, landed resets, p192 rows 5.09/um, LD ring, Stage 1 private ABI, DOMSPLIT o_pc 33+95), new pins, new macros. KV-GRP3 (s2 gate review): every s2 variant FAILED textbook.reset_landing (rst_n reached 13 flops, hrst_n 8: the per-leaf copies were cleared by the port) and grp_s2c had reg->out -133 ps on o_ctl[32] (i_up landed at the S face drove the N-face pin across the tile in one cycle).  s3: the port clears only the first landing stage (copies cleared by the landed stage, D = 1, same release edge), o_ctl / o_dn leave exit face flops (+1 core edge each, priced, KV-GEN9 inbox)."
  },
  "views_to": "physical/ref_tile/qkd_kvs_grp_h_s3c/views",
